  "description": "I would like to replace / install a new front door. The existing door is damaged, made from poor quality plywood and in my opinion is not secure. The new door will be the same flush style and red colour as the existing door but will be made from sold hardwood.  \n\nThe new door will also include new iron mongery, chrome letter plate, door knocker, yale and mortise locks but again this is the same style of iron mongery used with the existing door. ",
